{"lines":[{"t":"Test 2","h":0.013176483677183715,"w":0.060194174448649079,"y":0.042056074523459053,"x":0.091262135982795173,"c":1},{"x":0.091262143746970892,"w":0.80194173177083328,"y":0.088662790584305262,"c":1,"h":0.017567739159889961,"t":"The third phase of construction took place around 2000 BCE. At this point, sandstone"},{"t":"slabs - known as 'sarsens' - were arranged into an outer crescent or ring; some were","y":0.10747663562085452,"w":0.80388351440429684,"x":0.091262126193017823,"h":0.017523364485981352,"c":1},{"x":0.091185899237919629,"y":0.12572105577487602,"t":"assembled into the iconic three-pieced structures called trilithons that stand tall in the","w":0.80013036092122392,"c":1,"h":0.017643639751683926},{"h":0.021281223950727624,"t":"centre of Stonehenge. Some 50 of these stones are now visible on the site, which","w":0.76716389973958321,"c":1,"x":0.091182156098257958,"y":0.14385681828197883},{"t":"may once have contained many more. Radiocarbon dating has revealed that work","h":0.017511591807332749,"c":1,"x":0.091262144555170621,"y":0.1641744548106493,"w":0.7708737691243488},{"h":0.023318753584151697,"x":0.091154158045905445,"t":"continued at Stonehenge until roughly 1600 BCE, with the bluestones in particular being","w":0.82741190592447911,"c":1,"y":0.18088931762715232},{"c":1,"x":0.089320386776911301,"y":0.20342679155769516,"w":0.26213592529296875,"t":"repositioned multiple times.","h":0.016199376947040434},{"h":0.017496196354660931,"x":0.091262144566607611,"y":0.23831775723964377,"w":0.77087376912434891,"t":"But who were the builders of Stonehenge? In the 17th century, archaeologist John","c":1},{"w":0.78654698689778646,"y":0.25648806228379217,"h":0.019858987754750479,"x":0.091198102805954209,"c":1,"t":"Aubrey made the claim that Stonehenge was the work of druids, who had important"},{"c":1,"x":0.091149279735797575,"t":"religious, judicial and political roles in Celtic\" society. This theory was widely popularized","w":0.83128575642903635,"h":0.025116314991983635,"y":0.27025769099947439},{"c":1,"t":"by the antiquarian William Stukeley, who had unearthed primitive graves at the site.","x":0.091169345795624399,"h":0.021008481414889868,"w":0.78461847941080731,"y":0.29302646393263454},{"y":0.31201557143234515,"h":0.020361582438151005,"c":1,"x":0.093130649354442221,"t":"Even today, people who identify as modern druids continue to gather at Stonehenge for","w":0.81957550048828132},{"h":0.021885975870387986,"c":1,"x":0.091175317991962199,"w":0.83319630940755196,"t":"the summer solstice. However, in the mid-20th century, radiocarbon dating demonstrated","y":0.32945278532759648},{"w":0.79043909708658855,"x":0.091177855237755998,"h":0.021692305710456772,"y":0.34870028508157846,"t":"that Stonehenge stood more than 1,000 years before the Celts inhabited the region.","c":1},{"y":0.3880813952347596,"w":0.76116505940755208,"c":1,"x":0.093203878013687819,"t":"Many modern historians and archaeologists now agree that several distinct tribes","h":0.017526081120856518},{"t":"of people contributed to Stonehenge, each undertaking a different phase of its","w":0.73221557617187494,"c":1,"h":0.020695381521064538,"y":0.40492993259009691,"x":0.093117400749297488},{"h":0.020073455145054542,"w":0.78655339558919279,"t":"construction. Bones, tools and other artefacts found on the site seem to support this","x":0.093130883129771858,"y":0.42379101236458738,"c":1},{"h":0.019918676477355013,"t":"hypothesis. The first stage was achieved by Neolithic agrarians who were likely to have","y":0.44247826246655275,"x":0.091198684435452523,"w":0.81955693562825516,"c":1},{"w":0.82718444824218751,"h":0.017541476573528114,"c":1,"x":0.093203892376731684,"t":"been indigenous to the British Isles. Later, it is believed, groups with advanced tools and","y":0.46220930221108836},{"t":"a more communal way of life left their mark on the site. Some believe that they were","x":0.093127492442095366,"y":0.479553964336212,"w":0.78849034627278647,"h":0.019586882190169574,"c":1},{"h":0.020501953790492466,"c":1,"w":0.81950358072916663,"y":0.49850021683562162,"t":"immigrants from the European continent, while others maintain that they were probably","x":0.089286950527050712},{"y":0.51837008737490697,"t":"native Britons, descended from the original builders.","c":1,"h":0.020011655860972088,"w":0.49335698445638015,"x":0.091174870605331748},{"x":0.091210224853985084,"w":0.81757822672526026,"t":"If the facts surrounding the architects and construction of Stonehenge remain shadowy","y":0.55440676601551175,"h":0.018796142387984327,"c":1},{"y":0.57196965035591329,"x":0.093067980799327571,"w":0.81580729166666666,"t":"at best, the purpose of the striking monument is even more of a mystery. While there is","h":0.023363708781304782,"c":1},{"x":0.093102564203802182,"y":0.59108825362919271,"w":0.79437220255533858,"c":1,"h":0.020635848476136642,"t":"consensus among the majority of modern scholars that Stonehenge once served the"},{"h":0.020265732524550994,"c":1,"t":"function of burial ground, they have yet to determine what other purposes it had.","x":0.091202899377219065,"y":0.61122789758692753,"w":0.75739262898763027},{"w":0.80786534627278639,"h":0.020853595198871977,"c":1,"x":0.091218451882535967,"t":"In the 1960s, the astronomer Gerald Hawkins suggested that the cluster of megalithic","y":0.64801970895264116},{"x":0.093059861342127681,"w":0.83140141805013013,"h":0.024369580277772696,"y":0.66412710772569872,"c":1,"t":"stones operated as a form of calendar, with different points corresponding to astrological"},{"h":0.023660404288508796,"c":1,"w":0.79453826904296865,"t":"phenomena such as solstices, equinoxes and eclipses occurring at different times of","x":0.094959655936872125,"y":0.68333558175258702},{"x":0.093036889401163406,"y":0.70120165651683841,"t":"the year. While his theory has received a considerable amount of attention over the","h":0.022986253399715273,"w":0.78281270345052079,"c":1},{"x":0.094991966451950793,"w":0.78670949300130188,"h":0.024864812357774824,"c":1,"t":"decades, critics maintain that Stonehenge's builders probably lacked the knowledge","y":0.71987664085145364},{"h":0.023397549067702306,"w":0.76539957682291671,"y":0.73875398447272822,"t":"necessary to predict such events or that England's dense cloud cover would have","x":0.094966125951004107,"c":1},{"w":0.30485438028971357,"t":"obscured their view of the skies.","c":1,"x":0.095145625348568311,"y":0.76162790706335337,"h":0.015988371899566256},{"c":1,"x":0.095052765961142524,"y":0.79533576603195466,"w":0.83126027425130211,"h":0.022104230031046113,"t":"More recently, signs of illness and injury in the human remains unearthed at Stonehenge"},{"t":"led a group of British archaeologists to speculate that it was considered a place of","x":0.093138207763457312,"h":0.019842914331739236,"y":0.81537793082727394,"w":0.77296717325846365,"c":1},{"w":0.71861419677734373,"t":"healing, perhaps because bluestones were thought to have curative powers.","y":0.83363959654963249,"h":0.021353855311313508,"x":0.095048799296588229,"c":1},{"x":0.095119124435017952,"t":"** Celtic - The Celts were people who lived in Britain and northwest Europe during the Iron Age from 600 BCE to 43 CE","c":1,"w":0.7146361796061198,"y":0.93132516726311687,"h":0.013867371698777609},{"h":0.014534883112922281,"x":0.095145631163769076,"t":"40","y":0.9578488374472387,"c":1,"w":0.025242718060811367}],"w":2400,"h":3209}